{"id":"d93cc27ebf4fb0d3","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-admissible-set.md","title":"可容许集合与可容许序数","display":"df-admissible-set — 可容许集合与可容许序数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-admissible-set","aliases":["18-df-admissible-set"],"display":"df-admissible-set — 可容许集合与可容许序数","depends_on":["[[./18-df-transitive-set]]","[[./18-df-ordinal]]","[[./18-df-constructible-hierarchy]]","[[./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]]","[[./18-df-structure]]","[[./18-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"§11.4 following the definition of KPω","source_printed_pages":"248","source_pdf_pages":"257","source_correspondence":"explicit-local-expansion","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","source_proof_review":"定义的语法、类型及构造已核对；不据此宣称后续定理已证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-admissible-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-admissible-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-admissible-set — 可容许集合与可容许序数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b63d92760bb408d3\" href=\"?note=b63d92760bb408d3\" title=\"./18-df-transitive-set\">18-df-transitive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"./18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"635d9c2a8b21701e\" href=\"?note=635d9c2a8b21701e\" title=\"./18-df-constructible-hierarchy\">18-df-constructible-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e391b202f09e2f43\" href=\"?note=e391b202f09e2f43\" title=\"./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory\">18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ac3a6265513490d\" href=\"?note=9ac3a6265513490d\" title=\"./18-df-structure\">18-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"23419e8036fb68bd\" href=\"?note=23419e8036fb68bd\" title=\"./18-df-satisfaction\">18-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§11.4 following the definition of KPω"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"248"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"257"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"explicit-local-expansion"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"定义的语法、类型及构造已核对；不据此宣称后续定理已证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span> 及序数类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b63d92760bb408d3\" href=\"?note=b63d92760bb408d3\" title=\"./18-df-transitive-set\">18-df-transitive-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"./18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"635d9c2a8b21701e\" href=\"?note=635d9c2a8b21701e\" title=\"./18-df-constructible-hierarchy\">18-df-constructible-hierarchy</a> 的构造层级，仅在序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 上使用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\{\\in,=\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in=\\{\\in,=\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KP}\">\\(\\mathrm{KP}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KP}_\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{KP}_\\omega\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e391b202f09e2f43\" href=\"?note=e391b202f09e2f43\" title=\"./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory\">18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory</a> 中的具体句子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in^{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(\\in^{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"9ac3a6265513490d\" href=\"?note=9ac3a6265513490d\" title=\"./18-df-structure\">18-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"23419e8036fb68bd\" href=\"?note=23419e8036fb68bd\" title=\"./18-df-satisfaction\">18-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n<li>结构只解释集合域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上的真实属于关系；等号由逻辑等号解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adm},\\mathrm{Adm}_\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{Adm},\\mathrm{Adm}_\\omega\\)</span> 是集合上的谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdmOrd},\\mathrm{AdmOrd}_\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{AdmOrd},\\mathrm{AdmOrd}_\\omega\\)</span> 是以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 为域的类型化谓词，均在下式引入，不量化任意真类模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Adm}(A)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\mathrm{Trans}(A)\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land|\\mathfrak A|=A\n\\land\\in^{\\mathfrak A}=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A:x\\in y\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{KP}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models F)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Adm}_\\omega(A)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\mathrm{Trans}(A)\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land|\\mathfrak A|=A\n\\land\\in^{\\mathfrak A}=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A:x\\in y\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{KP}_\\omega\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models F)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Adm}(A)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\mathrm{Trans}(A)\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land|\\mathfrak A|=A\n\\land\\in^{\\mathfrak A}=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A:x\\in y\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{KP}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models F)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Adm}_\\omega(A)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\mathrm{Trans}(A)\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land|\\mathfrak A|=A\n\\land\\in^{\\mathfrak A}=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A:x\\in y\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{KP}_\\omega\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models F)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n\\mathrm{AdmOrd}(\\alpha)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Adm}(L_\\alpha),\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n\\mathrm{AdmOrd}_\\omega(\\alpha)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Adm}_\\omega(L_\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n\\mathrm{AdmOrd}(\\alpha)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Adm}(L_\\alpha),\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n\\mathrm{AdmOrd}_\\omega(\\alpha)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Adm}_\\omega(L_\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 p.248 的语义定义：传递集合满足 KP 称 admissible，满足 KPω 则称 admissible above ω；可容许序数由相应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span> 判定。结构非空性包含在 Struct 的来源定义中，故空集不会意外合格。这里只是外部集合论中的语义谓词，不能与扩语言里的未解释谓词符号 Ad 或其公理组直接混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./18-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"b63d92760bb408d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-transitive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-constructible-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"635d9c2a8b21701e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-constructible-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory","status":"resolved","id":"e391b202f09e2f43","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"9ac3a6265513490d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"23419e8036fb68bd